 County","/arc-plc/arkansas/greene-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 45% of normal in July to August and 25% in November to December. The 2026 year opened at 38% of normal in January to February on the middle of the grids. Grid 19059 had its driest year in 1963 at 53%.</p>"}
